{
 "name": "Activated abilities of the top card of your library — Conspicuous Snoop, Skill Borrower",
 "notes": "Found by tests/sweep.py. The card comes from the controller's 'Top of library' slot (Battlefield.setLibraryTop, player.libraryTop). Player 1's top card is Mogg Fanatic, a Goblin card, so Conspicuous Snoop has its ability. The opponent's top card is Prodigal Sorcerer, an artifact-or-creature card, so the opponent's Skill Borrower has its ability. Each reads only its own controller's library, and the 'As long as …' line itself stays in the ability list (the general condition pass used to file Skill Borrower's as a conditional ability).",
 "recipe": {
  "steps": [
   {
    "call": [
     "addPlayer",
     "Opponent"
    ]
   },
   {
    "add": "Conspicuous Snoop",
    "as": "snoop"
   },
   {
    "add": "Skill Borrower",
    "as": "borrower",
    "controller": "p2"
   },
